{"review_id": "60d3bc50-459f-4ad3-9ee8-30ea253673a6", "package": "com.genazemildo.my_habit_streak", "app_name": "My Habit Streak", "language": "en", "language_name": "English", "rating": 5, "text": "This is so cute and easy to use! I look forward to making the bee, flower, and ladybug happy! My request would be to be able to edit groups. I have one called Most Important, and I thought of a new habit to add to that group, but I can't. I don't think I can delete a group and start it again, either. This is minor. I ❤️ this!", "author": "Cristina Escobar", "date": "2026-01-09T15:46:04Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "1.0.13", "developer_reply": null}
{"review_id": "eeaf5cd3-a885-4b02-8f80-e71d2187ccdc", "package": "com.genazemildo.my_habit_streak", "app_name": "My Habit Streak", "language": "en", "language_name": "English", "rating": 5, "text": "Love the simplicity, and the design of the bee (edit: the one feature I'd ideally add is the option to set a custom \"time alert\" to check in on a streak)", "author": "Bibin Rajesh", "date": "2025-11-02T17:20:06Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "1.0.12", "developer_reply": null}
